---
config:
  theme: redux-color
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User as 사용자
    participant FE as Front-end<br/>(DeckBuilderView)
    participant Ctrl as Controller<br/>(SaveDeckController)
    participant Svc as Service<br/>(DefaultSavedDeckService)
    participant Validation as Service<br/>(DefaultDeckValidationService)
    participant Repo as Repository<br/>(DeckCommandRepository)
    participant DB as DB:deck<br/>/ deck_card

    User->>FE: 덱 이름, 메모, 포맷 입력 후 저장 요청
    activate FE
    FE->>Ctrl: save_deck(request)
    activate Ctrl
    Ctrl->>Svc: save(request)
    activate Svc

    Svc->>Validation: validate(request.items, request.ban_format)
    activate Validation
    Validation-->>Svc: DeckValidationResult 반환
    deactivate Validation

    alt [저장 가능]
        Svc->>Repo: save_deck(name, memo, ban_format, items)
        activate Repo
        Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO deck
        activate DB
        DB-->>Repo: deck_id 생성
        Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO deck_card
        DB-->>Repo: 카드 구성 저장 완료
        deactivate DB
        Repo-->>Svc: deck_id 반환
        deactivate Repo

        Svc-->>Ctrl: deck_id 반환
        Ctrl-->>FE: 저장 성공 결과 전달
        FE-->>User: 저장 완료 메시지 표시
    else [저장 불가]
        Svc-->>Ctrl: 오류 결과 반환
        Ctrl-->>FE: 저장 실패 결과 전달
        FE-->>User: 저장 실패 사유 표시
    end

    deactivate Svc
    deactivate Ctrl
    deactivate FE
